## 1. Overview

This waypoint records the completion of the current Organization Admin Workspace milestone and establishes the next development direction: Member Workspace Foundation.

The Organization Admin workspace now provides the intended organization-scoped administrative presentation layer separate from the Platform Super Admin Administration experience.

The Organization Admin workspace does not create a second Builder, second Runtime, or duplicate domain models.

The platform now has two administrative entry contexts:

Platform Super Admin
→ Administration
→ Selected Organization
→ Organization Workspace

and:

Organization Admin
→ Organization Workspace
→ Authorized Organization

The current organization context used by the Organization Admin workspace remains a navigation/development context. It is not a production authorization boundary.

Production tenant authorization, authentication, and PostgreSQL Row Level Security remain future security milestones.

The next product-facing milestone is Member Workspace Foundation.

